00:06:03.690 --> 00:06:06.910
Okay, so I think that
means we're all caught up.

00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:08.530
Now we can talk about
the legal implications

00:06:08.530 --> 00:06:10.140
of all of this erratic behavior.

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:12.370
Now in the face of Ye's
threats against Davidson

00:06:12.370 --> 00:06:15.180
and the unstable behavior
towards Miss Kardashian,

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:17.770
some have advised them to
get a restraining order.

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:20.080
So what are the options when it comes to

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:21.860
protecting themselves and the children

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:23.480
when it comes to a restraining order?

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:25.280
Well, let's start with the basics.

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:27.410
A restraining order, also
called a protective order,

00:06:27.410 --> 00:06:29.490
is a court order that
can protect an individual

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:31.320
from being physically or sexually abused,

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:33.160
threatened, stalked, or harassed.

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:34.930
The person the restraining
order is against

00:06:34.930 --> 00:06:36.570
is called the restrained person.

00:06:36.570 --> 00:06:38.370
The person requesting
the restraining order

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:40.090
is called the protected person,

00:06:40.090 --> 00:06:42.730
and restraining orders can be
broadened to include family

00:06:42.730 --> 00:06:44.080
or other household members

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:46.620
as part of that class
of protected persons.

00:06:46.620 --> 00:06:47.960
As the name suggests, a restraining order

00:06:47.960 --> 00:06:50.340
restrains the third party from
committing certain actions

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:51.830
against the protected persons.

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:54.630
And then one type of restriction
is a personal conduct order

00:06:54.630 --> 00:06:56.350
which prohibits the restrained party

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:58.570
from any of the following actions,

00:06:58.570 --> 00:07:01.270
including contacting the
the person attacking,

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:03.760
stalking, threatening,
sexually assaulting, harassing,

00:07:03.760 --> 00:07:05.818
destroying personal property
or disturbing the peace

00:07:05.818 --> 00:07:07.560
of those protected people.

00:07:07.560 --> 00:07:09.020
And a protected person can also obtain

00:07:09.020 --> 00:07:10.710
what's called a stay away order,

00:07:10.710 --> 00:07:12.270
which is probably the
kind of restraining order

00:07:12.270 --> 00:07:13.430
you're familiar with in the media,

00:07:13.430 --> 00:07:14.910
where a restrained person has to keep

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:17.318
a certain distance away
from the protected person

00:07:17.318 --> 00:07:19.829
or where that person
lives, their place of work,

00:07:19.829 --> 00:07:22.380
the children's school, their vehicle,

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:23.980
and other important places.

00:07:23.980 --> 00:07:26.461
And if that restrained person
violates the restraining order

00:07:26.461 --> 00:07:30.101
then they may be sent to
jail or pay a fine or both.

00:07:30.101 --> 00:07:32.540
Now, additionally, a domestic
violence restraining order

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:34.580
protects an individual
from abuse when the abused

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:37.733
and the abuser are or have been
in an intimate relationship.

00:07:37.733 --> 00:07:39.840
And the abuse prohibited is not limited

00:07:39.840 --> 00:07:41.700
to the actual infliction
of physical injury

00:07:41.700 --> 00:07:43.050
or committing assault,

00:07:43.050 --> 00:07:45.390
as psychological torment is also included.

00:07:45.390 --> 00:07:47.070
And if the parties haven't dated

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:49.010
and don't have a close relationship,

00:07:49.010 --> 00:07:50.470
then that falls under the purview

00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:52.530
of a civil harassment restraining order.

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:54.180
Since Ye and Kardashian were married

00:07:54.180 --> 00:07:55.230
and have children together,

00:07:55.230 --> 00:07:56.480
Kardashian might be able to seek

00:07:56.480 --> 00:07:58.070
a domestic violence restraining order

00:07:58.070 --> 00:07:59.930
while Pete Davidson
might be entitled to seek

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:01.640
a civil harassment order.

00:08:01.640 --> 00:08:03.220
Now just because Ye's outbursts have

00:08:03.220 --> 00:08:04.540
mostly played out on social media

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:06.836
doesn't make them any
less potentially alarming.

00:08:06.836 --> 00:08:09.661
On the contrary, Ye's escalation
on social media is typical

00:08:09.661 --> 00:08:12.910
of patterns that translate
into real world abuse.

00:08:12.910 --> 00:08:15.250
So could Ye's conduct actually support

00:08:15.250 --> 00:08:18.480
a domestic violence protective
order from Miss Kardashian?

00:08:18.480 --> 00:08:20.250
Well, if Kardashian shows that she has

00:08:20.250 --> 00:08:21.960
actually suffered emotional distress

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:24.200
or fear of harm as a
result of Ye's conduct,

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:25.450
and that fear is reasonable,

00:08:25.450 --> 00:08:26.790
then there's a decent chance a judge

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:28.960
would grant Kardashian
a restraining order.

00:08:28.960 --> 00:08:30.940
And here there are several
things that constitute abuse

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:32.540
that would give rise to an order,

00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:34.810
but what's most relevant here is that

00:08:34.810 --> 00:08:36.890
making someone reasonably afraid that they

00:08:36.890 --> 00:08:39.050
or someone else are about
to be seriously hurt

00:08:39.050 --> 00:08:41.003
through threats or promises to commit harm

00:08:41.003 --> 00:08:43.960
would qualify as abuse that would rise

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:45.870
to the level of a restraining order.

00:08:45.870 --> 00:08:47.250
And under California law,

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:49.500
a credible threat means
intentionally saying something

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:51.700
or acting in a way that would
make a reasonable person

00:08:51.700 --> 00:08:53.520
afraid for his or her safety,

00:08:53.520 --> 00:08:55.290
or the safety of his or her family.

00:08:55.290 --> 00:08:57.110
And a credible threat to violence includes

00:08:57.110 --> 00:08:59.360
following or stalking someone,
making harassing calls,

00:08:59.360 --> 00:09:02.550
sending harassing messages
by phone, email, mail,

00:09:02.550 --> 00:09:05.150
or over a period of time,
even if it's a short time.

00:09:05.150 --> 00:09:07.620
And a threat may be implied
by a pattern of conduct

00:09:07.620 --> 00:09:09.581
and need not be explicitly stated.

00:09:09.581 --> 00:09:11.490
Now some have questioned whether Ye's

00:09:11.490 --> 00:09:13.087
repeated efforts to win back Kardashian,

00:09:13.087 --> 00:09:15.525
even after she closed the
door on reconciliation,

00:09:15.525 --> 00:09:17.290
constitutes stalking.

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:20.590
In December, 2021, Ye purchased
the house across the street

00:09:20.590 --> 00:09:22.240
from his soon to be ex-wife's house,

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:24.690
purportedly so he could
be closer to his kids.

00:09:24.690 --> 00:09:26.320
Now during a charity
event that same month,

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:28.480
West, while Kardashian
and their daughter North

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:29.620
was in attendance,

00:09:29.620 --> 00:09:31.350
tweaked the lyrics of a song

00:09:31.350 --> 00:09:33.740
to beg for his estranged
wife to return to him.

00:09:33.740 --> 00:09:36.621
In February, 2022, Ye shared
a photo collage of Kardashian

00:09:36.621 --> 00:09:39.650
and their children where he
publicly pleaded with her

00:09:39.650 --> 00:09:41.010
to rekindle their romance,

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:42.817
writing in a since deleted post,

00:09:42.817 --> 00:09:45.170
"God please bring our
family back together."

00:09:45.170 --> 00:09:47.670
So is this stalking or a credible threat?

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:49.610
Well, this alone, probably not.

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:51.740
There are three common
defenses to stalking charges,

00:09:51.740 --> 00:09:53.980
that one, no credible threat was made,

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:56.020
that there was no intent to cause fear,

00:09:56.020 --> 00:09:57.810
and or three, that the activities

00:09:57.810 --> 00:09:59.430
were constitutionally protected.

00:09:59.430 --> 00:10:01.120
Now to date, there's been no indication

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:03.220
that Ye has made a
credible threat of violence

00:10:03.220 --> 00:10:06.560
against his ex or their
family or that his actions

00:10:06.560 --> 00:10:08.380
are calculated to cause fear.

00:10:08.380 --> 00:10:10.480
Ye's efforts to win back
his ex on social media

00:10:10.480 --> 00:10:13.050
are not coupled with what would normally

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:14.589
be considered threats to her safety.

00:10:14.589 --> 00:10:17.580
So they likely fall under
constitutionally protected speech.

00:10:17.580 --> 00:10:20.439
And while moving close to
one's ex can seem alarming,

00:10:20.439 --> 00:10:22.820
this act alone is not going to be enough

00:10:22.820 --> 00:10:24.350
to constitute stalking.

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:27.020
So Ye purchasing a house
to be closer to his kids

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:29.600
is likely not stalking in
the absence of threats.

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:32.120
Though it's potentially
possible that Ye's actions

00:10:32.120 --> 00:10:34.250
could fall under the broader
umbrella of harassment

00:10:34.250 --> 00:10:36.510
which includes threats of
violence that seriously scare,

00:10:36.510 --> 00:10:39.716
annoy or harass someone and
serves no legitimate purpose.

00:10:39.716 --> 00:10:41.640
And to constitute harassment,

00:10:41.640 --> 00:10:44.330
the offender must engage
in a course of conduct

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:46.010
that would cause a
reasonable person to suffer

00:10:46.010 --> 00:10:47.440
substantial emotional distress

00:10:47.440 --> 00:10:50.040
and must actually cause
substantial emotional distress

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:51.331
to the petitioner.

00:10:51.331 --> 00:10:53.280
Kardashian has already filed a motion

00:10:53.280 --> 00:10:54.570
in her divorce case saying that Ye's

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:56.017
social media posts were full of,

00:10:56.017 --> 00:10:58.550
"Misinformation regarding
our private family matters

00:10:58.550 --> 00:10:59.960
and co-parenting on social media

00:10:59.960 --> 00:11:01.830
which has created emotional distress."

00:11:01.830 --> 00:11:03.340
And according to one insider,

00:11:03.340 --> 00:11:05.730
Kim has grown particularly
disturbed by her ex

00:11:05.730 --> 00:11:07.960
when he alleged in a
mid-March Instagram post

00:11:07.960 --> 00:11:11.014
that Davidson, "Will hook her on drugs."

00:11:11.014 --> 00:11:13.690
This comment allegedly
alarmed Kardashians so much

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:16.108
that she hired security to
protect herself and Davidson.

00:11:16.108 --> 00:11:18.310
"She's scared and is so jumpy,

00:11:18.310 --> 00:11:20.200
she's really on her guard and making sure

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:21.490
she has security right now,

00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:24.480
and has asked Pete to
also take precautions."

00:11:24.480 --> 00:11:26.170
Now, California law allows parties

00:11:26.170 --> 00:11:27.900
to get a restraining order against conduct

00:11:27.900 --> 00:11:29.150
that disturbs a person's peace

00:11:29.150 --> 00:11:31.270
even in the absence of violent threats.

00:11:31.270 --> 00:11:33.000
And based on the publicly
available evidence,

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:35.270
it's possible that Kardashian has cause

00:11:35.270 --> 00:11:36.700
for a domestic violence restraining order

00:11:36.700 --> 00:11:39.173
against Ye for harassment
and disturbing her peace.

00:11:39.173 --> 00:11:40.850
But what about Pete Davidson?

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:42.220
Can he get a restraining order?

00:11:42.220 --> 00:11:44.327
And is rap music a criminal threat?

00:11:44.327 --> 00:11:46.890
Now, if you told me last
year that I was going to

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:50.036
analyze rap music using
Claymation to simulate murder,

00:11:50.036 --> 00:11:52.638
whether that could constitute a crime,

00:11:52.638 --> 00:11:55.100
honestly I probably
wouldn't have questioned it

00:11:55.100 --> 00:11:57.260
given how strange the
last few years have been.

00:11:57.260 --> 00:11:58.430
But let's dive into this thing.

00:11:58.430 --> 00:12:00.750
And as I mentioned, in Ye's song "Eazy",

00:12:00.750 --> 00:12:02.517
one of the lyrics threatens to,

00:12:02.517 --> 00:12:04.070
"Beat Pete Davidson's ass."

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:06.041
And in the first "Eazy" music video,

00:12:06.041 --> 00:12:09.500
he beheads and then buries
a Claymation Pete Davidson,

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:11.940
and in the next video Ye
has an animated Davidson

00:12:11.940 --> 00:12:13.310
beaten up by a monkey.

00:12:13.310 --> 00:12:14.920
Now in response to criticism,

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:17.600
Ye wrote on an Instagram
post that art is therapy

00:12:17.600 --> 00:12:19.807
and denied that he was making threats.

00:12:19.807 --> 00:12:22.100
"Art is not a proxy for ill or harm.

00:12:22.100 --> 00:12:23.880
Any suggestion otherwise about my art

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:25.820
is false and mal intended."

00:12:25.820 --> 00:12:28.140
So, did Ye commit a
crime in his music videos

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:29.480
by threatening to beat up Davidson

00:12:29.480 --> 00:12:32.770
while attacking animated
representations of Davidson?

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:34.650
And does Pete Davidson have any grounds

00:12:34.650 --> 00:12:36.920
for a civil harassment
restraining order against Ye?

00:12:36.920 --> 00:12:38.410
Well, Davidson's public statements

00:12:38.410 --> 00:12:40.520
that he's not afraid of Ye is probably not

00:12:40.520 --> 00:12:42.810
going to help his case
for threatening this

00:12:42.810 --> 00:12:44.536
as criminal conduct.

00:12:44.536 --> 00:12:46.320
Furthermore, the leaked text messages

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:48.460
between Ye and Davidson
purport to show Davidson

00:12:48.460 --> 00:12:50.950
eager to meet Ye in
public to talk things out,

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:53.250
which undermines a claim
that Davidson feels stalked

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:57.030
or harassed or suffering from
actionable sustained fear.

00:12:57.030 --> 00:13:00.400
And furthermore, the first
amendment gives a lot of leeway

00:13:00.400 --> 00:13:02.650
to artists and gives a
broad right to depict

00:13:02.650 --> 00:13:04.400
exaggerated violence
against public figures

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:07.020
so long as they don't directly
declare their intention

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:08.430
to actually hurt another person

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:10.591
or encourage others to do so.

00:13:10.591 --> 00:13:13.160
Like when Kathy Griffin
controversially held

00:13:13.160 --> 00:13:15.700
a mock severed head of
then president Trump.

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:17.340
It might have been in poor taste

00:13:17.340 --> 00:13:20.177
and knocked her from the
coveted C list to D list

00:13:20.177 --> 00:13:22.530
but it probably broke no laws.

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:25.050
Given Ye's denial that he
intended to threaten Davidson

00:13:25.050 --> 00:13:27.210
and Davidson's lack of fear,

00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:30.055
Ye's musical mutilation
is likely not a crime.

00:13:30.055 --> 00:13:32.100
Now that being said, there could be some

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:34.320
really severe consequences for Kanye,

00:13:34.320 --> 00:13:36.340
at least concerning his visitation rights

00:13:36.340 --> 00:13:37.960
and custody of his children.

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:39.820
For restrained persons,
a restraining order

00:13:39.820 --> 00:13:41.750
can have very serious consequences,

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:44.370
particularly in the context
of domestic violence.

00:13:44.370 --> 00:13:45.950
And if Kardashian successfully wins

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:48.080
a domestic violence
restraining order against Ye,

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:49.690
he could lose custody
of his young children

00:13:49.690 --> 00:13:53.150
and even lose the right to
be in their lives entirely.

00:13:53.150 --> 00:13:54.840
California law has special rules

00:13:54.840 --> 00:13:56.170
for custody and visitation rights

00:13:56.170 --> 00:13:57.940
when it comes to domestic violence.

00:13:57.940 --> 00:13:59.360
And a judge will treat your case

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:01.780
as a domestic violence matter if one,

00:14:01.780 --> 00:14:03.700
a parent has been convicted
of domestic violence

00:14:03.700 --> 00:14:05.460
against the other parent
in the last five years,

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:07.860
or two, any court has
decided that one parent

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:09.840
committed domestic violence
against another parent

00:14:09.840 --> 00:14:10.690
or the children.

00:14:10.690 --> 00:14:12.400
And in fact, under California law,

00:14:12.400 --> 00:14:15.123
a judge cannot award
custody joint or otherwise

00:14:15.123 --> 00:14:17.440
to the parent who
committed domestic violence

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:19.840
unless that abusive
parent meets the burden

00:14:19.840 --> 00:14:21.690
to show among other things that custody

00:14:21.690 --> 00:14:23.630
is in the best interest of the children,

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:25.970
the abusive parent committed a 52 week

00:14:25.970 --> 00:14:27.790
batter intervention program

00:14:27.790 --> 00:14:29.360
and has completed any court ordered

00:14:29.360 --> 00:14:31.770
substance abuse counseling
or parenting class,

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:34.100
has complied with any restraining orders

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:37.020
and has not committed any
further domestic violence.

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:39.470
If Kardashian obtains a domestic
violence restraining order,

00:14:39.470 --> 00:14:41.800
it's possible though,
not incredibly likely,

00:14:41.800 --> 00:14:43.710
that Ye could lose all right to custody,

00:14:43.710 --> 00:14:45.560
be subject to supervised visitation

00:14:45.560 --> 00:14:47.560
or even be ordered to stay
at least a hundred yards

00:14:47.560 --> 00:14:49.450
away from his ex and their young children.

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:51.410
Ye could be ordered to stop communicating

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:53.140
with Kardashian and Davidson both directly

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:54.730
and indirectly via social media.

00:14:54.730 --> 00:14:57.330
And in fact, the family
law judge handling divorce

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:59.430
could order Ye to stop
discussing the divorce,

00:14:59.430 --> 00:15:02.980
his kids and his ex-wife's
new boyfriend with the public

00:15:02.980 --> 00:15:04.920
if Kardashian proves
that she feels threatened

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:06.750
or harmed by this conduct.

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:08.050
Now throughout this entire ordeal,

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:09.980
Ye has maintained that
he's always been acting

00:15:09.980 --> 00:15:11.670
in the best interest of his children,

00:15:11.670 --> 00:15:13.160
but if Ye doesn't get his act together

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:14.650
and stop with this bizarre

00:15:14.650 --> 00:15:16.570
and potentially menacing behavior,

00:15:16.570 --> 00:15:19.026
he risks losing his family forever.

